What:		/proc/sentry_uvb_comm/server_cna
Date:		April 2025
Contact:	Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. <sxt1001@huawei.com>
Description:
		Configure and display server CNA
		values for UVB communication.

		Write Format:
			"cna1;cna2;cna3;..." - Multiple CNA values separated by semicolons

		Read Format:
			"cna1;cna2;cna3;..." - Same format as write

		Examples:
			# Set server CNAs
			echo "100;200;300" > /proc/sentry_uvb_comm/server_cna

			# Read current server CNAs
			cat /proc/sentry_uvb_comm/server_cna
			100;200;300

		Notes:
		- Each CNA must be a valid unsigned 32-bit integer
		- Invalid CNAs (>= CNA_MAX_VALUE) are filtered out